      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oklahoma%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Across the Kiskiminetas River to the east, the borough meets Armstrong County’s North Apollo, Apollo, and Kiskiminetas Township.",
